        {
            "id": "https://costalong.com/2026/06/06/searxng-docker-deploy/",
            "url": "https://costalong.com/2026/06/06/searxng-docker-deploy/",
            "title": "用 Docker 自建 SearXNG，给 Claude 当搜索后端",
            "date_published": "2026-06-06T04:00:00.000Z",
            "content_html": "<p><img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" style=\"--img-ar:1.6000\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_906051d53ec5.webp\" alt=\"本机跑起来的 SearXNG 首页\"></p>\n<p>搜个技术问题，Google 第一页常常是 SEO 农场；换 Bing，广告比结果还多；DuckDuckGo 不错，但结果质量不稳定。自己跑一个 SearXNG 之后，”自己掌控搜索入口”这件事的门槛其实很低：一条 Docker 命令起服务，聚合多个搜索源，无 cookie、无画像，搜索记录留在自己机器上。</p>\n<p>更实际的用途是给 AI 当搜索后端。SearXNG 有标准的 JSON 接口，接进 Claude Desktop、Claude Code 或者自己写的 Claude API 应用，就有了一个不按次计费的搜索工具。本文覆盖：Docker / Compose 部署、settings.yml 关键项、反向代理、常见坑，以及三种接入 Claude 的方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"SearXNG-是什么\"><a href=\"#SearXNG-是什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"SearXNG 是什么\"></a>SearXNG 是什么</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/searxng/searxng\">SearXNG</a> 是一个<strong>元搜索引擎</strong>（metasearch engine）：自己不抓网页，而是把你的查询同时发给 Google、Bing、Brave、DuckDuckGo、Startpage、Wikipedia 等搜索源，把结果去重、排序、合并后展示。</p>\n<p><img width=\"1228\" height=\"900\" style=\"--img-ar:1.3644\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_f2a50931879f.webp\" alt=\"SearXNG 的 GitHub 仓库首页\"></p>\n<p>它和 DuckDuckGo 的区别在于：DuckDuckGo 是别人运营的服务，你只能相信它的隐私承诺；SearXNG 是<strong>你自己部署</strong>的服务端，请求从浏览器到你的实例，再由实例代你去问各个上游，中间没有需要信任的第三方。</p>\n<p>几个基本事实（来自官方仓库和文档）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>许可证</strong>：AGPL-3.0；</li>\n<li><strong>技术栈</strong>：Python，容器镜像里用 Granian 作为应用服务器，相关参数通过 <code>$GRANIAN_*</code> 环境变量配置；</li>\n<li><strong>缓存</strong>：可选接 Valkey（Redis 的分支），主要用于限流（limiter）等功能，单纯搜索不依赖它；</li>\n<li><strong>镜像</strong>：<code>docker.io/searxng/searxng</code>，版本号是日期格式，比如 <code>2026.6.5-xxxxxxx</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适合谁</strong>：有自托管习惯的人，不想被单一搜索源绑定的人，想给团队或家人提供统一搜索入口的人，以及需要一个免费搜索 API 喂给 LLM 的人。<br><strong>不适合谁</strong>：完全不想运维的人（直接用 DuckDuckGo 或 Kagi）；高 QPS、对延迟敏感的生产场景（单实例扛不住，而且上游会限流）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Docker-一行启动\"><a href=\"#Docker-一行启动\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Docker 一行启动\"></a>Docker 一行启动</h2><p>先说部署方式的变化：以前流行的 <code>searxng/searxng-docker</code> 仓库<strong>已经归档</strong>，官方现在的容器方案放在主仓库的 <code>container/</code> 目录下，文档见 <a href=\"https://docs.searxng.org/admin/installation-docker.html\">Installation container</a>。最快的方式是文档里这条 <code>docker run</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">docker</span> run <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--name</span> searxng <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-d</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-p</span> <span class=\"token number\">8888</span>:8080 <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./config/:/etc/searxng/\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-v</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"./data/:/var/cache/searxng/\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    docker.io/searxng/searxng:latest</code></pre>\n\n<p><img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" style=\"--img-ar:1.6000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_02a5622738c3.webp\" alt=\"SearXNG 官方容器安装文档页\"></p>\n<p>逐项说明：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>-p 8888:8080</code>：宿主机 8888 映射到容器内的 8080（容器默认监听 8080）；</li>\n<li><code>-v \"./config/:/etc/searxng/\"</code>：配置目录，<code>settings.yml</code> 在这里；</li>\n<li><code>-v \"./data/:/var/cache/searxng/\"</code>：数据目录，持久化缓存；</li>\n<li>镜像支持 amd64 和 arm64。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>容器启动时如果发现 <code>/etc/searxng/settings.yml</code> 不存在，会从模板复制一份，并把里面的 <code>secret_key</code> 占位值替换成随机串。所以第一次不用准备任何配置文件，跑起来后去 <code>./config/settings.yml</code> 改就行。</p>\n<p>浏览器打开 <code>http://localhost:8888</code> 就是上面那张首页。命令行验证一下：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-s</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-o</span> /dev/null <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-w</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"HTTP %{http_code}<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\n\">\\n</span>\"</span> http://localhost:8888/\n<span class=\"token comment\"># HTTP 200</span></code></pre>\n\n<h2 id=\"Compose-部署\"><a href=\"#Compose-部署\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Compose 部署\"></a>Compose 部署</h2><p>长期使用建议用 Compose，把 SearXNG 和 Valkey 编排在一起。官方模板在主仓库的 <code>container/</code> 下：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-p</span> ./searxng/core-config/\n<span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> ./searxng/\n<span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-fsSL</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-O</span> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/searxng/searxng/master/container/docker-compose.yml <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-O</span> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/searxng/searxng/master/container/.env.example\n<span class=\"token function\">cp</span> .env.example .env\n<span class=\"token function\">docker</span> compose up <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-d</span></code></pre>\n\n<p><code>docker-compose.yml</code> 定义了两个服务：<code>core</code>（容器名 <code>searxng-core</code>）和 <code>valkey</code>（容器名 <code>searxng-valkey</code>，只在内部网络暴露 6379）。<code>.env</code> 里可以设置：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token comment\"># 固定镜像版本，默认 latest</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#SEARXNG_VERSION=latest</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 监听地址和端口，默认 8080</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#SEARXNG_HOST=127.0.0.1</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\">#SEARXNG_PORT=8080</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>注意两点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Compose 模式默认端口是 8080，不是 8888</strong>，而且容器内外用的是同一个 <code>SEARXNG_PORT</code>。8080 被占了就改 <code>.env</code>，不用动 yaml。只给本机或反代用的话，把 <code>SEARXNG_HOST</code> 设成 <code>127.0.0.1</code>，避免直接暴露到公网。</li>\n<li><strong>Valkey 起来了不等于 SearXNG 在用它。</strong> 默认 <code>settings.yml</code> 里 <code>valkey.url</code> 是 <code>false</code>。要启用限流（<code>server.limiter: true</code>）等依赖 Valkey 的功能时，把地址指向 Compose 里的服务名：</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" data-language=\"yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">valkey</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">url</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> valkey<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//valkey<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>6379/0</code></pre>\n\n<p>升级按官方文档的三步：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">docker</span> compose down\n<span class=\"token function\">docker</span> compose pull\n<span class=\"token function\">docker</span> compose up <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-d</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>下文的例子沿用 <code>docker run</code> 的 8888 端口，Compose 用户自行换成 8080。</p>\n<h2 id=\"settings-yml-关键项\"><a href=\"#settings-yml-关键项\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"settings.yml 关键项\"></a>settings.yml 关键项</h2><p>配置文件在容器内是 <code>/etc/searxng/settings.yml</code>，对应宿主机的 <code>./config/settings.yml</code>（<code>docker run</code>）或 <code>./searxng/core-config/settings.yml</code>（Compose）。<strong>改完需要重启容器才生效</strong>：<code>docker restart searxng</code> 或 <code>docker compose restart core</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"打开-JSON-输出（接-API-和-MCP-必改）\"><a href=\"#打开-JSON-输出（接-API-和-MCP-必改）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"打开 JSON 输出（接 API 和 MCP 必改）\"></a>打开 JSON 输出（接 API 和 MCP 必改）</h3><p>默认配置只开了 HTML 输出：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" data-language=\"yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">formats</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> html</code></pre>\n\n<p>这时请求 <code>format=json</code> 会直接返回 <strong>403 Forbidden</strong>。后面所有 API、MCP 接入都依赖 JSON，所以先把它加上：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" data-language=\"yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">formats</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> html\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> json</code></pre>\n\n<p>重启后验证：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-s</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"http://localhost:8888/search?q=docker+pull&amp;format=json\"</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">\\</span>\n    <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> jq <span class=\"token string\">'.results[0:2][] | {title, url, engine}'</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>每条结果包含 <code>title</code>、<code>url</code>、<code>content</code>（摘要）、<code>engine</code>（来自哪个上游）等字段，结构自描述，RAG 管道可以直接消费。注意：实例一旦暴露到公网，开放 JSON 接口就等于开放了一个免费搜索 API，务必配合下文的限流。</p>\n<h3 id=\"secret-key\"><a href=\"#secret-key\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"secret_key\"></a>secret_key</h3><p>容器首次启动会自动生成随机的 <code>secret_key</code>。如果你是从别处拷来的 <code>settings.yml</code>，确认它不是默认的 <code>ultrasecretkey</code>，否则自己换一个：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">openssl rand <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-hex</span> <span class=\"token number\">32</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>也可以不改文件，用环境变量 <code>SEARXNG_SECRET</code> 覆盖。</p>\n<h3 id=\"启用和禁用引擎\"><a href=\"#启用和禁用引擎\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"启用和禁用引擎\"></a>启用和禁用引擎</h3><p>引擎列表在 <code>engines:</code> 段，每个引擎用 <code>disabled: true</code> 关掉，不写这一项就是启用：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" data-language=\"yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">engines</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> google\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">engine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> google\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">shortcut</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> go\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">disabled</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>     <span class=\"token comment\"># 关掉 Google</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> <span class=\"token key atrule\">name</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> duckduckgo\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">engine</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> duckduckgo\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">shortcut</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> ddg</code></pre>\n\n<p>哪些引擎默认启用，不同版本会调整，以你自己 <code>settings.yml</code> 里的实际值为准。经常超时的引擎可以单独加 <code>timeout: 5.0</code>（秒）覆盖全局的 <code>outgoing.request_timeout</code>（默认 3 秒）。</p>\n<p>普通用户也可以在浏览器里改：<code>/preferences</code> 的”搜索引擎”标签页，每行一个引擎，可以开关，并能看到权重、响应时间、可靠性等信息。这里的修改存在浏览器 cookie 里，只影响当前浏览器：</p>\n<p><img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" style=\"--img-ar:1.6000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_3b6da253f81c.webp\" alt=\"SearXNG 首选项的搜索引擎标签页：逐个引擎开关，并显示权重和响应时间\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"出站代理\"><a href=\"#出站代理\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"出站代理\"></a>出站代理</h3><p>如果你的服务器访问不了部分上游（国内网络环境下很常见），所有引擎都会超时。SearXNG 支持给出站请求配代理：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-yaml\" data-language=\"yaml\"><code class=\"language-yaml\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">outgoing</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token key atrule\">proxies</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token key atrule\">all://</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> http<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>//127.0.0.1<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span><span class=\"token number\">7890</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>代理地址换成你自己的。容器里的 <code>127.0.0.1</code> 指容器本身，代理跑在宿主机上的话，要用宿主机在 Docker 网络里的地址。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反向代理-HTTPS\"><a href=\"#反向代理-HTTPS\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"反向代理 + HTTPS\"></a>反向代理 + HTTPS</h2><p>要给家人或团队用，或者想绑域名，就加一层反向代理并上 HTTPS。Caddy 最省事，证书自动申请、自动续期。域名是 <code>search.example.com</code> 的话：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-caddy\" data-language=\"caddy\"><code class=\"language-caddy\">search.example.com {\n    reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:8888\n}</code></pre>\n\n<p>Nginx 思路一样，只是证书要自己用 certbot 或 acme.sh 管：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-nginx\" data-language=\"nginx\"><code class=\"language-nginx\"><span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server</span></span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">listen</span> <span class=\"token number\">443</span> ssl</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">http2</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">on</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">server_name</span> search.example.com</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">ssl_certificate</span>     /etc/letsencrypt/live/search.example.com/fullchain.pem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">ssl_certificate_key</span> /etc/letsencrypt/live/search.example.com/privkey.pem</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n\n    <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">location</span> /</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_pass</span> http://127.0.0.1:8888</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> Host <span class=\"token variable\">$host</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> X-Real-IP <span class=\"token variable\">$remote_addr</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-For <span class=\"token variable\">$proxy_add_x_forwarded_for</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"token directive\"><span class=\"token keyword\">proxy_set_header</span> X-Forwarded-Proto <span class=\"token variable\">$scheme</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>公网实例建议：在反代上做限流，同时开启 SearXNG 自带的 <code>server.limiter</code>（需要 Valkey，见上文），否则很快会被人当免费搜索 API 刷，上游也会因此封你的出口 IP。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见的坑\"><a href=\"#常见的坑\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常见的坑\"></a>常见的坑</h2><p><strong>访问 8888 超时或 connection refused</strong>：先看容器是否在跑、端口是否绑定：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">docker</span> <span class=\"token function\">ps</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--filter</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"name=searxng\"</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">--format</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"table {{.Names}}<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\t\">\\t</span>{{.Status}}<span class=\"token entity\" title=\"\\t\">\\t</span>{{.Ports}}\"</span></code></pre>\n\n<p><img width=\"1100\" height=\"124\" style=\"--img-ar:8.8710\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_af58855a515f.webp\" alt=\"docker ps 输出：searxng 容器在运行，8888 端口已映射到容器 8080\"></p>\n<p>端口没列出来，或者容器反复重启，就看 <code>docker logs searxng</code>。宿主机 8888 被别的程序占用时，换成 <code>-p 8889:8080</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>页面能打开，但搜索结果全空、右侧全是”超时”</strong>：</p>\n<p><img width=\"1280\" height=\"800\" style=\"--img-ar:1.6000\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/images/posts/searxng-docker-deploy_206214fb2e0c.webp\" alt=\"搜索无结果，右侧显示 brave、duckduckgo、google 等 6 个引擎全部超时\"></p>\n<p>这几乎都是出站网络问题：实例访问不到上游搜索引擎。容器默认和宿主机走同一个出口，先在宿主机上测一下连通性，不通就按上文配 <code>outgoing.proxies</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">curl</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-sI</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-m</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span> https://duckduckgo.com <span class=\"token operator\">|</span> <span class=\"token function\">head</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-1</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>另外检查是不是把引擎全禁用了，这种情况下 SearXNG 不报错，只是搜不出东西。</p>\n<p><strong><code>format=json</code> 返回 403</strong>：<code>search.formats</code> 里没有 <code>json</code>，见上文。</p>\n<p><strong>改了 settings.yml 后容器起不来</strong>：多半是 YAML 缩进或语法错误。看 <code>docker logs searxng</code>（Compose 用 <code>docker compose logs core</code>），报错会指出出错位置。改之前先备份一份能用的配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"接入-Claude\"><a href=\"#接入-Claude\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"接入 Claude\"></a>接入 Claude</h2><p>SearXNG 的 JSON 接口可以通过 MCP 或者自定义工具接给 Claude。下面三种方式按上手成本从低到高排列。前提都是上文已经打开了 JSON 输出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Claude-Desktop：mcp-searxng\"><a href=\"#Claude-Desktop：mcp-searxng\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Claude Desktop：mcp-searxng\"></a>Claude Desktop：mcp-searxng</h3><p>社区维护的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ihor-sokoliuk/mcp-searxng\">mcp-searxng</a> 把 SearXNG 包装成 MCP server，提供 <code>searxng_web_search</code>（搜索）和 <code>web_url_read</code>（读取网页正文）两个工具。它是 npm 包，需要 Node.js 22 或更高版本。</p>\n<p>macOS 上编辑 <code>~/Library/Application Support/Claude/claude_desktop_config.json</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-json\" data-language=\"json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"mcpServers\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"searxng\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"command\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"npx\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"-y\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"mcp-searxng\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"env\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"SEARXNG_URL\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"http://localhost:8888\"</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>改完<strong>彻底退出 Claude Desktop 再打开</strong>（菜单栏 Quit，不是关窗口），在工具列表里看到 searxng 的两个工具就说明接通了。</p>\n<p>隐私上要分清：SearXNG 这一侧不留记录，但对话内容（包括搜索关键词）仍然会发给 Claude。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Claude-Code\"><a href=\"#Claude-Code\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Claude Code\"></a>Claude Code</h3><p>项目级配置写在仓库根目录的 <code>.mcp.json</code>：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-json\" data-language=\"json\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"mcpServers\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token property\">\"searxng\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"stdio\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"command\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"npx\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"args\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"-y\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"mcp-searxng\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n      <span class=\"token property\">\"env\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token property\">\"SEARXNG_URL\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"http://localhost:8888\"</span>\n      <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>或者用 CLI 添加（默认只对当前项目、当前用户生效，加 <code>-s project</code> 会写进 <code>.mcp.json</code>）：</p>\n<pre class=\"language-bash\" data-language=\"bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">claude mcp <span class=\"token function\">add</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-e</span> <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">SEARXNG_URL</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>http://localhost:8888 searxng -- npx <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-y</span> mcp-searxng</code></pre>\n\n<p>之后 Claude Code 里会出现 <code>mcp__searxng__searxng_web_search</code> 这样的工具（命名规则是 <code>mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;</code>），需要查资料时它会自己调用，你也可以在提示里直接说”用 searxng 查一下”。</p>\n<p>团队协作时，各人的 SearXNG 地址往往不同（端口不同，或者用的是反代域名）。可以在 <code>.mcp.json</code> 里写 <code>\"SEARXNG_URL\": \"${SEARXNG_URL}\"</code>，让每个人在自己的环境变量里设置，而不是把某个人的地址提交进仓库。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Claude-API：自定义-web-search-工具\"><a href=\"#Claude-API：自定义-web-search-工具\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Claude API：自定义 web_search 工具\"></a>Claude API：自定义 web_search 工具</h3><p>自己写应用时，把 SearXNG 包成一个工具交给 Claude 即可。下面是完整的多轮 tool_use 循环：Claude 可能连续调用多次搜索，每一轮都要把 assistant 的完整回复和所有 <code>tool_result</code> 追加进对话历史，直到它不再请求工具。</p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" data-language=\"python\"><code class=\"language-python\"><span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> anthropic\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> requests\n\nclient <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> anthropic<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Anthropic<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nSEARXNG <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"http://localhost:8888\"</span>\nMODEL <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"claude-sonnet-5-5\"</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">web_search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">int</span> <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token number\">5</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    r <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> requests<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>SEARXNG<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">/search\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        params<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"q\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> query<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"format\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"json\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        timeout<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">15</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    r<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>raise_for_status<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> r<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>json<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>max_results<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"- [</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'title'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">](</span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">'url'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">): </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>x<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'content'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">''</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span> <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> x <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> results\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n\ntools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"name\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"web_search\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"Search the web via a self-hosted SearXNG instance. \"</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"Use for information that may be newer than your training data.\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token string\">\"input_schema\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"object\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"properties\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"string\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"搜索关键词\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token string\">\"max_results\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"integer\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"description\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"返回条数，默认 5\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token string\">\"required\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"query\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">ask</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>question<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    messages <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> question<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">while</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        resp <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> client<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n            model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>MODEL<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> max_tokens<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">4096</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> messages<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n        <span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> resp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>stop_reason <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_use\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>join<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>b<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>text <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> b <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> resp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> b<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">type</span> <span class=\"token operator\">==</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"text\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 原样追加 assistant 回复，再把本轮所有工具结果放进同一条 user 消息</span>\n        messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"assistant\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> resp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        results <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> block <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> resp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>content<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> block<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">type</span> <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_use\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">continue</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">try</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> is_error <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> web_search<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">**</span>block<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">input</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">False</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"token keyword\">as</span> e<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> is_error <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"search failed: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>e<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n            results<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_result\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"tool_use_id\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> block<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token builtin\">id</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> content<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n                <span class=\"token string\">\"is_error\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> is_error<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n            <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        messages<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>append<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"role\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"user\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"content\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> results<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ask<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">\"SearXNG 的引擎权重（weight）是怎么影响排序的？\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code></pre>\n\n<p>几个要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>历史要累积</strong>：每轮都把 <code>resp.content</code> 原样追加回去，不要只拼第一轮的消息，否则多轮搜索时 Claude 会丢掉前面的上下文；</li>\n<li><strong>同一轮的多个 <code>tool_use</code> 一起回</strong>：Claude 可能一次并行发起多个搜索，所有 <code>tool_result</code> 放进同一条 user 消息；</li>\n<li><strong>失败也要回结果</strong>：搜索出错时返回 <code>is_error: True</code> 的 <code>tool_result</code>，让 Claude 自己决定换关键词还是放弃，而不是让循环直接崩掉；</li>\n<li><strong>控制返回体积</strong>：搜索结果会进入上下文，<code>max_results</code> 不宜太大，摘要过长可以截断。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>和商业搜索 API 相比，自建 SearXNG 没有按次计费和月度额度，代价是要自己运维、延迟更高（多源聚合要等最慢的上游或超时），而且上游引擎可能因请求过多临时封禁你的出口 IP。重复查询多的场景，在 <code>web_search</code> 外面加一层短时缓存会有明显收益。</p>\n<hr>\n<p>如果你已经有一个自己的搜索聚合服务（比如把 SearXNG 和其他搜索 API、网页抓取服务组合成一个 MCP server），接入方式也一样：在服务的配置里把 SearXNG 地址设成 <code>SEARXNG_URL=http://localhost:8888</code>，它就成了一个免费、可控的聚合底座。我自己的做法正是这样，搜索请求优先走本地 SearXNG，失败再降级到其他搜索源。</p>\n<p>下一步可以研究的是引擎权重（<code>weight</code>）调优，以及公网实例的限流和防刷配置。</p>\n",
